      "updated": 1786469988837,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The requirement here is to design a system for gated-community management platform where third \nparty apps like Zomato, Swiggy, Blinkit, Zepto which will notify gated-community apps for pre-approval \nnotification. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The requirement here is to design a system for gated-community management platform where third \nparty apps like Zomato, Swiggy, Blinkit, Zepto which will notify gated-community apps for pre-approval \nnotification. ",
