      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786473241072,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So whenever user orders something on those platforms a \nwebhook will be created and our service will resolve the \naddress and notify the gated system apps for approval. ",
      "fontSize": 30.28571428571437,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So whenever user orders something on those platforms a \nwebhook will be created and our service will resolve the \naddress and notify the gated system apps for approval. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
